---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} slug={slug}>
  <AppShell>
    <div class="max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto py-12 px-4">
      <AppProse>

<p><em>Last reviewed April 2026.</em></p>

<h1>Guideline Alternatives: Top Competing Tools for 2026</h1>

<p>Guideline combines media plan management with ad intelligence built on aggregated transaction data. Teams compare alternatives when they need stronger buying workflow, lighter planning tools, different finance integrations, or a less enterprise-heavy implementation.</p>

<h2>Quick Comparison</h2>

